        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Function: every element of $A$ has exactly one output.",
          "worked": "Each of $1$, $2$, $3$ and $4$ is paired with exactly one output, $a$. Different inputs may share an output, so this relation is a function from $A$ to $B$.",
