        "answer": {
          "short": "Not a function from $A$ to $B$: $4$ has no output.",
          "worked": "The specified input set is $A=\\{1,2,3,4\\}$. There is no ordered pair with first coordinate $4$, so an element of $A$ has no output. The relation is therefore not a function from $A$ to $B$.",
